Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.68,0:00:01.98,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:04.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Tonkatsu curry is so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.73,0:00:08.73,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey, Blade. You've got food on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:11.18,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'll wipe it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:16.87,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.87,0:00:18.96,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What are you two doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}You{\i0} brought it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.00,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Heya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.00,0:00:24.04,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Anna, mind if we join you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.34,0:00:25.95,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You're still calling me Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.45,0:00:27.54,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Not that I mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.97,0:00:29.73,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Thanks, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.02,0:00:32.47,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Hey, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:34.47,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,How do these outfits look on us?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:36.09,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,How, you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:39.31,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Oh, I suddenly feel so self-conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.82,0:00:42.13,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's right. Today's the day, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.13,0:00:44.48,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Congratulations on moving up,\Nall four of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.71,0:00:45.63,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.63,0:00:47.73,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You mean they're all in the advanced class?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.73,0:00:49.84,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Didn't even notice, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.84,0:00:52.10,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,That's why we're allowed to dress freely now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:53.47,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,So how do we look?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.47,0:00:54.36,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Any thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.74,0:00:55.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I bet you're freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.37,0:01:00.62,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Why, how do you do, my fair ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.62,0:01:04.37,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm utterly entranced by your beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:06.25,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.25,0:01:07.15,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Hey, Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:09.09,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Who's this gorgeous fella here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.39,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,I'm quite flattered, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:15.13,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I love all \Nwomen in equal measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.67,0:01:18.45,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,I cannot let myself be bound to just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.41,0:01:18.45,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,We get it, Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.45,0:01:21.10,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Anyway, Blade, have you heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:22.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:26.52,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I hear His Majesty the King is having a \Nmagical beast brought here to the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.14,0:01:30.21,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,You mean we have to fight it for training?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.21,0:01:32.37,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,No way, that's way too extreme...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.37,0:01:33.57,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:34.95,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,"Hmm," you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.95,0:01:35.86,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's a magical beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:39.17,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't put it past that old fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.17,0:01:41.56,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,"Old fart"?! That's lèse-majesté!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.56,0:01:43.28,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Whatever, he deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.18,0:01:46.14,Class- Default,Student G,0,0,0,,An earthquake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.46,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:51.02,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wait, could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:53.75,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:01:57.48,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We should have everyone take shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.04,0:01:59.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.81,0:03:34.98,sign_3812_25_Episode_1,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(568,1)}Episode 3
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:34.98,sign_5097_53_Cu_Chulainn,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(653,1)\pos(211.6,220)}Cu Chulainn
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.87,0:03:40.64,Class- Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Someone call for His Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.64,0:03:43.68,Class- Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,He's the only one who can handle a dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.68,0:03:44.37,Class- Default,Crowd 1,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:45.36,Class- Default,Crowd 2,0,0,0,,Take cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.12,0:03:50.55,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,This is the magical beast?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:51.29,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:53.28,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,A dragon?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:03:58.30,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:06.14,Class- Default,Crowd 3,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.14,0:04:08.36,Class- Default,Crowd 4,0,0,0,,You there, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.36,0:04:09.37,Class- Default,Crowd 5,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:19.11,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.31,0:04:24.07,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.37,0:04:27.83,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, did you just subdue a \Ndragon with your bare hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.13,0:04:30.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh? This one's still young.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.76,0:04:33.09,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You must have been scared, \Nbeing dragged all the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.09,0:04:34.83,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Or are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.38,0:04:37.10,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:42.11,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Too spicy for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:44.44,Class- Default,Student D,0,0,0,,No way... Without any weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.91,0:04:45.59,Class - Top,Student Q,0,0,0,,A dragon, with one blow?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:45.59,Class- Default,Student E,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.51,0:04:49.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,No way, this is normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.40,0:04:51.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's normal, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:59.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's not like it's a Great Dragon,\Nor an Ancient Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.02,0:05:01.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Anyone could take down this \Nlittle dragon with a single hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:05.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.41,0:05:08.07,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:09.17,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.17,0:05:11.00,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,B-Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:12.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Behind me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:15.47,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.47,0:05:16.50,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Whoa, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.95,0:05:19.63,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,So you're my parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:20.45,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Parent?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.45,0:05:22.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:23.78,Class - Top,Cu,0,0,0,,I've finally found you, Parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.78,0:05:25.38,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,So play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.38,0:05:28.03,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'll go and find your parents later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.03,0:05:29.20,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.20,0:05:32.14,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Anyway, where did that dragon run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.14,0:05:36.14,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Th-Th-The dragon shrank \Ndown into that little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:35.09,Class - Top,Cu,0,0,0,,Play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.09,0:05:38.01,Class - Top,Cu,0,0,0,,Parent, play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:39.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh? That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.01,0:05:40.26,Class - Top,Cu,0,0,0,,Play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:41.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, be quiet for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:42.02,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Aye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.02,0:05:47.40,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,If you insist, I am more \Nthan willing to be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.26,0:05:47.40,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.74,0:05:49.48,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So, where's the dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.48,0:05:51.14,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Like I said, that girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.14,0:05:52.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Surely you joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.60,0:05:54.99,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Blade. I saw it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.99,0:05:56.91,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Her true form is a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.91,0:05:57.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.79,0:05:58.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,She's a dragon, for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.71,0:06:00.71,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's what I've been saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:02.84,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Why do you believe Sophie and not me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.84,0:06:03.93,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.93,0:06:06.01,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I did as you said and stayed quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.01,0:06:08.61,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,A whole ten seconds, just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:11.13,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Now play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:13.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Wait, why are you calling me your parent?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.26,0:06:16.16,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,That punch earlier was something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:18.51,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I'd expect nothing less from my parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.51,0:06:20.29,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.29,0:06:23.36,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Play with me! Play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.07,0:06:23.90,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Wh-What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.36,0:06:24.80,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:27.40,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Play with me! Play with me! Play with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.41,0:06:34.24,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,The roots of my horns are sensitive!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:36.05,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Don't be rough with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.05,0:06:37.90,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sure, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:40.79,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,How'd I end up doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.35,0:06:42.35,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,That tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.35,0:06:44.17,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, don't run away, Cu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.99,0:06:47.17,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.39,0:06:51.68,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,What does the name you gave me, \NCu Chulainn, mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:57.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's the name of a devoted knight, who was \Nreally strong and always kept promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.56,0:07:00.84,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Aye. I can keep a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.84,0:07:03.74,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,A dragon upholds an oath \Neven if it costs them their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:05.44,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.44,0:07:07.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Where are you, Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.28,0:07:09.32,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Y-You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.32,0:07:11.95,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,If you were in the bath, \Nyou should have said so!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:14.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, you didn't give me any time to respond!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:16.22,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So, did you learn anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:17.41,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.08,0:07:22.44,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Magical beasts, including dragons, \Nare creatures who seek out strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.54,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,When one is vanquished, its flesh may perish,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:29.55,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,but a fragment of its soul lingers \Nas an agglomerate of knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.55,0:07:33.39,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,And when that soul becomes \Nincarnated as another entity,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.39,0:07:36.81,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,it mimics the shape of the \Nstronger being that finished it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.27,0:07:40.02,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's an evolutionary \Ninstinct to seek out strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:44.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So you mean a dragon defeated by a \Nhuman can end up taking a human form?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.81,0:07:47.22,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,But it's an extremely rare occurrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.22,0:07:51.10,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Not a lot of humans can take down \Na high-level beast like a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.10,0:07:53.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh? Y-Yeah, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:57.08,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You think Cu was vanquished \Nby a human in her past life?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.08,0:07:59.99,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Cu? That's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:01.18,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Did you give her that name, Blade?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.18,0:08:02.47,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.47,0:08:04.60,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,It's a name that pleases me greatly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:05.50,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.91,0:08:07.29,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Earnest?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:10.26,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.81,0:08:11.76,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:13.28,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:14.37,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:22.76,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Parent, I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.76,0:08:24.70,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You can feed yourself, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:25.28,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:32.37,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly capable of \Nfeeding myself, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.37,0:08:36.78,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,However, being fed by Parent makes \Nthe food taste that much better!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:41.91,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Um, do you mind if I also feed Cu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:43.16,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:46.96,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I won't be friends with weakling humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.52,0:08:46.96,Class - Top,Yessica,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.96,0:08:49.14,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey! Look at how scared Claire is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.14,0:08:54.05,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You're my parent now,\Nso you should only pay attention to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.05,0:08:57.96,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,In the morning, you need to \Ngive me good morning smooches,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.96,0:09:01.68,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,and for meals, you must let me \Nsit in your lap and feed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:02.81,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Ah. Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:03.85,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,You do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:05.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.26,0:09:07.34,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Morning... smooches...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:09.11,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I haven't done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.73,0:09:14.12,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Besides, you spend all your time \Nstaring at mature adult female bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.12,0:09:16.24,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I find that unacceptable!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.24,0:09:16.99,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:19.41,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, don't go wandering off by—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.19,0:09:19.41,Class - Top,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wait, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:20.41,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,You were staring?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.41,0:09:21.69,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,At what, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.69,0:09:23.37,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Sounds like he's guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.37,0:09:25.21,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,What an awful thing to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.21,0:09:26.13,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,He's guilty, all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:26.71,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,Guilty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:28.22,Class- Default,Leonard,0,0,0,,Not gentlemanly at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.22,0:09:30.57,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I can only describe you as despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.57,0:09:31.38,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:34.92,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,By unanimous verdict,\Nwe the jury find Blade guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.93,0:09:44.07,Class- Default,Priestess,0,0,0,,Um, Earnest...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.07,0:09:47.56,Class- Default,Scientist,0,0,0,,Blade's looking at us \Nlike he wants to join in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:49.69,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,And so what if he does?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:50.64,Class- Default,Priestess,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.64,0:09:51.82,Class- Default,Scientist,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.39,0:09:58.97,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey! Cu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.97,0:10:00.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Wanna join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:11.21,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I don't need any training, \Nbut if you insist, Parent,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.21,0:10:14.59,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I'm more than willing to show off my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:16.56,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.99,0:10:16.56,Class - Top,Clay,0,0,0,,Hey, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.56,0:10:18.80,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,We were told to group up with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.76,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Show us the ropes for the advanced class.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:22.26,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.77,0:10:26.17,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Hey, I was hoping to specialize \Nin espionage as a spy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:27.70,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Who should I have teach me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.70,0:10:29.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie would be the one with those skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.95,0:10:31.52,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Sophity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:33.02,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,...Ty?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.02,0:10:34.65,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Sophity!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.65,0:10:35.40,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:37.65,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Then I guess it'll be us four.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:39.15,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Oh, almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.48,0:10:41.16,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.16,0:10:43.31,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Where did Cu run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:44.37,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Cu?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.37,0:10:46.91,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Man, she never listens to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.64,0:10:51.92,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Nothing beats morning smooches!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.38,0:11:07.93,Class- Default,Student K,0,0,0,,That girl's back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.64,0:11:10.71,Class- Default,Student B,0,0,0,,If you're interested, wanna join in?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.71,0:11:11.69,Class- Default,Student B,0,0,0,,We'd be happy to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.69,0:11:15.44,Class- Default,Student N,0,0,0,,Won't you be friends with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:22.72,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You're no match for me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.43,0:11:29.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What were you up to, Cu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.72,0:11:33.26,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:34.87,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Never mind that, Parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.87,0:11:36.59,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,My stomach is empty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.59,0:11:38.21,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I'm starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.21,0:11:40.22,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Okay, tonkatsu curry it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:42.59,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You know me too well!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.59,0:11:45.14,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,But don't make it spicy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:48.35,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Also, I absolutely refuse to eat carrots!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.92,0:12:07.51,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Blade, are you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.80,0:12:13.84,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragons are tormented by their parents \Nimmediately after they're born.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.84,0:12:17.45,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The child, learning that something \Nstronger than it exists,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:19.46,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,imprints onto that thing as its parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.46,0:12:21.26,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,So that's why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.26,0:12:25.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Maybe she's been alone since she was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:28.39,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You realize though, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:31.64,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You can't keep pretending to be her parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.24,0:12:34.06,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.06,0:12:39.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But if I'm not there as her parent, \Nshe'll end up truly alone in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.78,0:12:43.77,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You know how much it \Nhurts to be alone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:44.78,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.78,0:12:47.41,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to argue \Nanything after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.27,0:12:49.53,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.22,0:12:51.45,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.45,0:12:56.29,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Now I know that you were serious when \Nyou decided to take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.77,0:12:58.88,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,That reassured you as well, right, Sophie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.35,0:13:00.25,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sophie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.22,0:13:06.58,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wait, you didn't realize she was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:09.12,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I ran into her on my way to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.12,0:13:10.79,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,She's just like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:13.08,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Looks like she was worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:17.15,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Things are going well with Cu,\Nand there's nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.91,0:13:18.83,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.85,0:13:23.37,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'll be heading back, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.37,0:13:27.78,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want rumors to spread about \Nme sneaking off at night to see a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.67,0:13:35.16,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:45.18,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Cu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.00,0:13:53.37,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Looking at those calms me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.97,0:13:55.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,The moons, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:59.27,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,The big one's the parent,\Nand the small one's the child.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.27,0:14:01.90,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,That's why they're always together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:05.12,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I would look up at them all the time \Nwhen I was alone in the wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:06.24,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, Cu...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.24,0:14:09.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Deep down, don't you want to make friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:12.41,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Parent, you're gravely mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.86,0:14:17.83,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Dragons are far sturdier than humans, \Nboth physically and mentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.83,0:14:19.19,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,We do not form flocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.19,0:14:21.67,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,We live alone, and we die alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.67,0:14:24.38,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,That's what it means to be a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:27.74,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Therefore, I have no need for friends at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:31.00,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Besides, the only one I need is you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:32.68,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You sure are strong, Cu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.68,0:14:35.06,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,That hurts, Parent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:40.95,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I swear, you sure are hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.32,0:14:48.29,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Do you realize exactly who I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:53.77,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,This isn't a day care center.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.77,0:14:54.91,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Look, who else can I turn to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.23,0:14:58.67,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,We're the only two people \Nwho can look after Cu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.67,0:15:00.21,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So, where's Cu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:03.01,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Oh, do I have a story for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.08,0:15:06.73,Class - Flashback,King,0,0,0,,You're so adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.73,0:15:08.16,Class - Flashback,King,0,0,0,,Cuddle, cuddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.24,0:15:11.58,Class - Flashback,King,0,0,0,,Cuddle, cuddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:13.00,Class - Flashback,King,0,0,0,,Ow, that smarts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.00,0:15:13.81,Class - Flashback,Cu,0,0,0,,Your beard is so prickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:14.84,Class - Flashback,Cu,0,0,0,,Is that an attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.84,0:15:17.06,Class - Flashback,Cu,0,0,0,,Are you attacking me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.06,0:15:19.56,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,She burst out of the room, just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You can't even babysit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.40,0:15:22.27,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,So useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.27,0:15:23.28,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.28,0:15:26.35,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Being reprimanded isn't half-bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.35,0:15:27.87,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Scold me harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.87,0:15:29.57,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,This guy's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.97,0:15:33.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.40,0:15:35.58,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Where in the world did Cu go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.04,0:15:41.92,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Come now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:43.69,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You mustn't bully that dragon whelp!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:45.59,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Why, the poor thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:47.72,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Agh! You've got the wrong idea, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.72,0:15:49.46,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I wasn't bullying her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.46,0:15:50.22,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Glower!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.16,0:15:53.58,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You fool! That won't work!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.58,0:15:56.48,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,What?! My eyebeam attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:58.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are those dolls supposed \Nto be me and Earnest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.86,0:16:00.80,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Bullying is wrong! Always!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.80,0:16:02.80,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Earnest, you're incorrigible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.80,0:16:05.48,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.48,0:16:07.98,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,You fool! I won't accept your apology!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.26,0:16:09.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}What awful slander.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.58,0:16:13.59,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:16.85,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Can you please be friends with my daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:18.37,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Roger. Totes can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:19.49,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sophie?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:25.30,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Head pats for Cu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:26.45,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Not fair, Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.45,0:16:28.13,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,I want to pat her head, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:29.86,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}Claire and Yessica, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:33.26,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Oh! I love all women in equal measure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.82,0:16:35.61,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's gotta be Leonard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.61,0:16:37.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}That said, she sure is observant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.83,0:16:46.52,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Hello, Altia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.82,0:16:48.21,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Good morning, Ilya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:50.16,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Makino, late again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.16,0:16:52.07,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Karima, good day to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.07,0:16:54.63,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Marcia, Michael, Eddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:56.24,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,How have you all been?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:59.16,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Curtis, Isabella, Marie, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.16,0:17:00.72,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:05.76,Class - Top,Cu,0,0,0,,James, Sarah, Zuimos, Herrera, Olga, Irina!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:04.03,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}I haven't heard these names before...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.03,0:17:05.76,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}Every student in the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.76,0:17:06.54,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:08.07,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.07,0:17:11.92,Class- Default,Cu,0,0,0,,That makes 108 friends for my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.93,0:17:24.95,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,{\i1}I didn't even notice...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.19,0:17:32.49,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Oh, did you find Cu?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.71,0:17:44.08,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.83,0:17:51.59,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You idiot! Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.59,0:17:55.22,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Hey! Cut it out, Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.16,0:17:59.22,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Tell me exactly what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.40,0:18:06.40,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,What Cu needs are friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.40,0:18:07.98,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Yes, I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:11.11,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,But it's not possible because of her nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.60,0:18:15.92,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Dragons can't acknowledge anyone \Nweaker than them as an equal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.92,0:18:17.55,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It's not in their nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.08,0:18:20.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,For her to recognize someone as her friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.46,0:18:22.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,they need to defeat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.37,0:18:25.66,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It doesn't mean anything if I beat her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.53,0:18:27.87,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I can't be her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:31.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.38,0:18:34.38,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Nope. There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.51,0:18:39.61,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,In that case, turn to someone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.61,0:18:42.00,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,You can't fix it all by yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.00,0:18:43.64,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,If so, then depend on others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:47.89,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I asked you for help not too long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.28,0:18:50.63,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,It's unfair!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.63,0:18:53.59,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I relied on you,\Nyet you won't do the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.59,0:18:55.28,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,What intolerable arrogance!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.04,0:18:55.28,Class - Top,Blade,0,0,0,,Well, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:57.78,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Just shut up and reach out for help!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:18:59.15,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,From me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.15,0:19:00.94,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,From all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.67,0:19:12.84,Class- Default,Student B,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.84,0:19:14.34,Class- Default,Student M,0,0,0,,The Empress?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.34,0:19:15.75,Class- Default,Student I,0,0,0,,The new kid's with her, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.56,0:19:26.80,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.80,0:19:28.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,You know Cu, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.80,0:19:32.60,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I want you to fight Cu, \Na dragon, and beat her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.60,0:19:34.68,Class- Default,Student B,0,0,0,,Easier said than done...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:37.12,Class- Default,Student L,0,0,0,,We can't go up against a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:39.53,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.00,0:19:44.02,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Please become friends with my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.02,0:19:46.04,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,I'm asking you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.04,0:19:47.16,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Please, fight alongside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.16,0:19:48.62,Class- Default,Student C,0,0,0,,Empress?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:50.29,Class- Default,Student L,0,0,0,,Oh no, Lady Earnest!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.89,0:19:57.13,Class- Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,We're here to make the same request.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:02.38,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:06.24,Class- Default,Claire,0,0,0,,We're worried about Cu as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.24,0:20:07.50,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Please, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.50,0:20:08.51,Class- Default,Yessica,0,0,0,,Do it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:09.58,Class- Default,Clay,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.58,0:20:10.89,Class- Default,Kassim,0,0,0,,We're on our knees here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.40,0:20:16.36,Class- Default,Student B,0,0,0,,O-Okay, we'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.36,0:20:18.15,Class- Default,Student L,0,0,0,,Please stop kneeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.42,0:20:21.34,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,We'll do whatever you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.45,0:20:44.38,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,That's more like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.75,0:20:48.56,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,This is the kind of hands-on \Ntraining I wanted to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:50.00,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,But you know, Gil,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:53.64,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,will a dragon even acknowledge defeat \Nif it's taken down by such a large group?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.64,0:20:54.78,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Why, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.78,0:20:59.65,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,In the eyes of a dragon, humans are \Ncreatures that work collectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:04.15,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,Do you consider bees cowardly \Nfor fighting as a swarm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.15,0:21:05.16,Class- Default,Siren,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.16,0:21:08.08,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,To a dragon, humans are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:10.16,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,They wouldn't consider it playing dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.67,0:21:15.90,Class- Default,King,0,0,0,,That said, it's a shame I won't \Nbe able to watch him fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.38,0:21:21.71,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I won't mind if you accidentally \Nbreathe fire on that old blowhard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:26.47,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Hey, Cu.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.47,0:21:28.22,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,I hear that when the humans captured you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:31.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,they sprung a trap on you, so you \Ncouldn't fight to your heart's content.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.89,0:21:33.43,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,It must have been frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.88,0:21:36.12,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,This time, it'll be fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.12,0:21:38.36,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Go on and see just how \Ntough we humans can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.95,0:21:41.21,Class- Default,Blade,0,0,0,,Show everyone what your strengths are!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.16,0:21:55.50,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.50,0:21:56.79,Class- Default,Earnest,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.79,0:21:58.42,Class- Default,Group,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
